# This working directory holds far more than the addon repo (reverse-engineering
# research, huge game-derived data under Input/, scratch files, etc.) per the
# workflow described in CLAUDE.md. Only the addon itself and repo scaffolding are
# tracked here — everything else is ignored by default.
/*

!/total_war_buildings/
!/file_format_specs/
!/AGENTS.md
!/CLAUDE.md
!/README.md
!/LICENSE
!/.gitignore
!/.github/

# Python bytecode caches anywhere under the addon.
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Test/debug fixtures produced by running scripts/*_test.py and scripts/bisect_*.py —
# not addon source. Some are byte-for-byte copies of real game data used for BOB
# crash bisection (see CLAUDE.md's validation-discipline section), so none of these
# generated .CS2/.blend outputs belong in the repo regardless.
/total_war_buildings/scripts/*.CS2
/total_war_buildings/scripts/*.blend
/total_war_buildings/scripts/*.blend1
